# Rare OS: the launcher's virtual touchscreen for Android touch controls (rare-android touch.rs) is
# for Android only. Android reads it directly; gamescope's input stack leaves it alone, so a
# touch never lands twice (or rotated) through the compositor.
SUBSYSTEM=="input", ATTRS{name}=="Rare Android Touch", ENV{LIBINPUT_IGNORE_DEVICE}="1", ENV{ID_INPUT_TOUCHSCREEN}=""
